{"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/keyboardmanager.KeyboardManager\/documentation\/KeyboardManager\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn how to integrate KeyboardManager into your iOS app to handle keyboard notifications efficiently."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"KeyboardManager provides three primary ways to observe keyboard events:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Event-based observation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" - Listen to specific keyboard events","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Constraint-based observation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" - Automatically adjust view constraints","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"ScrollView observation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" - Automatically adjust scroll view insets"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Basic-Event-Observation","text":"Basic Event Observation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The most flexible approach is to observe keyboard events directly:"}]},{"code":["import KeyboardManager","","class ViewController: UIViewController {","    private var keyboardToken: KeyboardObserverToken?","    ","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        setupKeyboardObserver()","    }","    ","    private func setupKeyboardObserver() {","        keyboardToken = KeyboardObserver.addObserver { event in","            switch event {","            case .willShow(let data):","                \/\/ Keyboard will appear","                print(\"Keyboard height: \\(data.frame.end.height)\")","                ","            case .willHide(let data):","                \/\/ Keyboard will disappear","                print(\"Keyboard hiding with duration: \\(data.animationDuration)\")","                ","            default:","                break","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Constraint-Based-Observation","text":"Constraint-Based Observation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For automatic constraint adjustment:"}]},{"code":["keyboardToken = KeyboardObserver.addObserver(","    superview: view,","    bottomConstraint: bottomConstraint,","    bottomOffset: 16.0,","    animated: true",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"ScrollView-Observation","text":"ScrollView Observation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For automatic scroll view adjustment:"}]},{"code":["keyboardToken = KeyboardObserver.addObserver(scrollView: scrollView)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep a strong reference to the returned "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeyboardObserverToken"},{"type":"text","text":" to maintain the subscription. The observation automatically stops when the token is deallocated."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/keyboardmanager.KeyboardManager\/documentation\/KeyboardManager"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"KeyboardManager"}],"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with KeyboardManager"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/keyboardmanager\/gettingstarted"]}],"references":{"doc://keyboardmanager.KeyboardManager/documentation/KeyboardManager":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/keyboardmanager.KeyboardManager\/documentation\/KeyboardManager","title":"KeyboardManager","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/keyboardmanager","abstract":[{"text":"Simple wrapper for UIKeyboard notification events that simplifies keyboard handling in iOS apps.","type":"text"}]}}}